<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Knowledge development in this area is still </span><span style="margin: 0px">emerging</span></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">, but the following offers a helpful starting point with insights into competencies and an overview of </span><span style="margin: 0px">different types</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of practices.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Competencies You Need</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Although there is limited empirical research on the exact requirements of these teaching roles, recent studies (e.g., Veltman et al., 2022; Oonk et al., 2020; Flavian, 2024) highlight the following competencies:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="1" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 47px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Flexibility and adaptability</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">You navigate unpredictable learning processes, shift roles as needed, and tailor your approach to diverse learning needs.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="2" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 47px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Interdisciplinary understanding and content breadth</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">You </span><span style="margin: 0px">don’t</span><span style="margin: 0px"> need to be an expert in every field, but you can make connections between disciplines and help students do the same.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="3" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 47px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Mediation and communication skills</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 71px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">You </span><span style="margin: 0px">maintain</span><span style="margin: 0px"> relationships with external partners and create a safe space for dialogue between different perspectives.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="4" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 47px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Coaching students</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 71px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">You support students in developing transdisciplinary competencies such as critical thinking, collaboration, and self-reflection.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="5" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 47px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Curiosity and professional development</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">You continuously develop yourself and remain open to new forms of education and feedback from practice.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="6" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 47px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Dealing with tensions</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 71px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">You help students (and yourself) cope with uncertainty, ambiguity, and tensions that arise when learning together about complex problems.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">These competencies take time to develop and highlight the importance of professional space and support within the team and organization. Not every educator </span><span style="margin: 0px">immediately</span><span style="margin: 0px"> feels comfortable in this role — </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important to be open about this and to learn together.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">References</span><span style="margin: 0px">:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Flavian, H. (2024). Transdisciplinary Teaching: Main Concepts and Perspectives. In Transdisciplinary Teaching in Inclusive Schools: Promoting Transdisciplinary Education for Learners with Special Needs (</span><span style="margin: 0px">pp</span><span style="margin: 0px">. 1-15). Cham: Springer International Publishing.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Oonk, C., Gulikers, J. T., den Brok, P. J., Wesselink, R., Beers, P. J., &amp; Mulder, M. (2020). Teachers as brokers: adding a university-society perspective to higher education teacher competence profiles. Higher Education, 80(4), 701-718/</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Veltman, M., Van Keulen, J., &amp; Voogt, J. (2022): Teacher strategies that foster students’ </span><span style="margin: 0px">boundarycrossing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">expertise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> when addressing problems with wicked tendencies, Journal of Vocational Education &amp; Training.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div></body>
